<VI _name="RemoteVI Swallow Button Up.vi" description="Drops the button-up of a click that RemoteVI Menu Click.vi turned into keys (docs\5Carchitecture.md\2C Popups)\3A the button-down chose a menu item with VK_RETURN\2C the menu closed\2C and the up would otherwise reach the panel as a stray WM_xBUTTONUP at whatever control lies under the menu. When posts starts with a button-up (WM_LBUTTONUP 514\2C WM_RBUTTONUP 517\2C WM_MBUTTONUP 520) and the menu pointer state (RemoteVI Menu Pointer.vi) has swallow up set\2C posts out is empty. Any button-up or button-down clears swallow up\2C so at most the one next up is dropped. Otherwise posts passes through.">
